{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GraphGeneration","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A10GenerationV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"GraphGeneration.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration.swift#L57"},"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GraphGeneration","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"GraphProtocols"}],"title":"GraphGeneration"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A graph’s generation: which structural state of which graph storage it is."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-1rsfw","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-1t817","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-3zt2o","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-5kltt","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-scjl"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/untracked"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GraphGeneration","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every structural mutation (an insertion, a removal, re-pointing an edge) starts a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"generation. Reserving capacity and writing attached map values do not. A structure derived from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a graph stores the graph’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"generation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"isCurrent(for:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before it relies on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graph again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A copy of a graph has the same generation as the original until either is mutated. Views and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adaptors (a transposed view, an undirected view, a wrapper such as "},{"code":"DirectedAcyclicGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report their base’s generation, so a view and its base, though they may describe different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"graphs, have equal generations. "},{"code":"isCurrent(for:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" answers only whether the storage of the graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passed in is in the state the generation was read from; it does not tell which view the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generation was read through. An untracked generation, from a representation that does not track"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generations or a mutable graph never mutated, is current for no graph. Equal tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generations are the same structural state of the same storage, and every untracked generation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equals every other."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graphgeneration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/SQ","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/GraphGeneration/isCurrent(for:)-1t817":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isCurrent"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP","text":"DirectedHypergraph"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"isCurrent(for:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hypergraph"},{"type":"text","text":" has not been structurally mutated since this generation was read from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it (or from a copy of it, or from a view or adaptor over the same storage). O(1)."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration\/isCurrent(for:)-1t817","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graphgeneration\/iscurrent(for:)-1t817"},"doc://GraphProtocols/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/G